AMD's Vulkan frame generation swapchain (FidelityFX SDK v1.1.4), for Linux:
- up to three generated frames per rendered one (DLSS Multi Frame Generation), set with the
  swapchain key FFX_FI_SWAPCHAIN_CONFIGURE_KEY_GENERATED_FRAMES, paced evenly;
- a failed generation shows only the rendered frame instead of a stale generated one;
- two constructs only MSVC accepts.
Applied by CMakeLists.txt to a copy of the swapchain sources.

